{room, key=deepgrid_floor_80, name=The Lounge
    {attrib, output=false, tags=tested }
    {attrib, tags=navigation
        output={@
Elevator enters the elevator.
        }
    }


    {enter_message
        output={@
The elevator opens to a large rooftop lounge.
Overhead is a mesh of dotted purple lights. Along the edges of the roof,
translucent panels reach up far overhead to meet the mesh of lights.
Abstract geometric shapes pulse over the surfaces of the panels, in time
with the atmospheric synthesizer music that fills the place.

Large glowing cubes sit in random positions throughout the lounge.

There's a small bank of video games to the right of the bar.

Small tables dot the floor and a few large, outward facing, circular chairs
fill the center of the place. There are some comfortable-looking couches
along the edges of the lounge and directly before you is a wide bar with
two augmented bartenders mixing drinks behind it.

        }

        {logic, name=Deepgrid floor 80 lounge tested, tags=!_test
            logic={@
                ?[self]((tested)) = 'true'
            }
        }
    }

    {look
        {message
            output={@
You look around...

Large glowing cubes sit in random positions throughout the lounge.

There's a small bank of video games to the right of the bar.

Small tables dot the floor and a few large, outward facing, circular chairs
fill the center of the place. There are some comfortable-looking couches
along the edges of the lounge and directly before you is a wide bar with
two augmented bartenders mixing drinks behind it.

            }
        }
    }




    {inject, logic=/nav.inj }
    {inject, logic=/look.inj }


    {inject, logic=./injections/bar.inj }
    {inject, logic=./injections/chairs.inj }
    {inject, logic=./injections/couches.inj }
    {inject, logic=./injections/cubes.inj }
    {inject, logic=./injections/lights.inj }
    {inject, logic=./injections/panels.inj }
    {inject, logic=./injections/tables.inj }
    {inject, logic=./injections/vidgames.inj }



    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((elevator))
        {move, logic=deepgrid_elevator, tags=[player]
            output={@
You press the elevator button. A moment later, one of the doors slide open.
You step inside.
            }
        }
    }
}
